---
// Section 3: Paryay Dschool Deep Dive with GSAP Stagger triggers
---

<section id="paryay-dschool" class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white border-y border-ink-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-12 sm:space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Top Editorial Lead -->
    <div class="reveal-item max-w-3xl space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-lime-subtle border border-lime-accent/50 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-dark font-bold">
        <span>03 / Alternative Education Focus</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-ink-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.12]">
        What kind of school does your child truly need?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
        Children struggling to achieve marks, syllabi designed for internal competition, and systems working solely around examinations: <span class="font-bold text-ink-900">how are children actually learning to think and gain skills for life?</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-Card Parent Concern Bento Stack -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="reveal-item reveal-delay-1 bg-canvas rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-ink-200/80 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-lime-accent transition-colors">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white border border-ink-200 flex items-center justify-center font-display font-black text-brand-forest text-sm">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">
            What about board exams &amp; standards?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
            Learners appear directly for 10th and 12th standard examinations via the Government of India’s <strong>NIOS</strong> or Maharashtra State Board (<strong>MsBOS</strong>). Both are 100% legally recognized for higher education.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-ink-200/60 mt-4 text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-forest uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
          ✓ Govt. Validated
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="reveal-item reveal-delay-2 bg-canvas rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-ink-200/80 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-lime-accent transition-colors">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-lime-accent flex items-center justify-center font-display font-black text-ink-900 text-sm">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">
            How is learner progress mapped?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
            With <strong>one mentor for every 6 learners</strong>, individual processes are documented closely. Monthly joint reviews are held with parents and learners through open discussion, not rote memorization.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-ink-200/60 mt-4 text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-forest uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
          ✓ 1:6 Dedicated Ratio
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="reveal-item reveal-delay-3 bg-canvas rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-ink-200/80 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-lime-accent transition-colors">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white border border-ink-200 flex items-center justify-center font-display font-black text-brand-forest text-sm">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">
            Can a child transfer to regular school?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
            Yes. Due to Maharashtra Government GRs, learners can seamlessly transfer into standard age-appropriate classes in mainstream schools if needed, with high self-reliance and confidence.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-ink-200/60 mt-4 text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-forest uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
          ✓ Seamless Mobility
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="reveal-item reveal-delay-4 bg-canvas rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-ink-200/80 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-lime-accent transition-colors">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-lime-accent flex items-center justify-center font-display font-black text-ink-900 text-sm">
            04
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">
            How are the school fees decided?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
            Fees are determined collaboratively based on the family’s socio-cultural and economic standing. No commercial overheads, no unnecessary fees, and total financial transparency.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-ink-200/60 mt-4 text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-forest uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
          ✓ Equitable Learning
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Authentic Field Study Tour Banner -->
    <div class="reveal-item relative rounded-3xl sm:rounded-4xl overflow-hidden p-6 sm:p-10 bg-brand-dark text-white flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-card">
      <div class="space-y-2 max-w-xl">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-lime-accent text-ink-900">
          Field Immersion
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">
          Study tours big &amp; small to experience real content.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
          Learners regularly travel across rural and ecological habitats, interacting with diverse artisans, scientists, and farmers across socio-cultural backgrounds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a 
          href="https://ecotude.wordpress.com/" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 h-12 px-6 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-900 bg-white hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-all shadow-sm"
        >
          <span>Read Learner Blog (Ecotude)</span>
          <span class="text-sm">&nearr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
